 "text": "Hello there! How's your day treating you? Not at all. Picknicking is great way to spend a day outdoors by yourself. Do you want to find a spot and pack the food, or would you rather pick a spot and leave the food at home? Okay, no problem. So far, the total is looking healthy, but we still have a few days left. Some families are debating whether to set a budget for the day trip or keep it loose. We've had a few families choose budget, usually around £20 per person. That's fair. The key is having a plan in place before you go, so you don't overspend.",
